operator: Hmmm... looks like an Alophia drummondii seed.
operator: Better known as a propeller flower.
operator: This is a little outside their native range...
operator: But once again, curiously unmodified.
operator: Through both their shape and their use in perfumes, I think the Green Arsenal will probably emphasize its relationship with wind.
operator: I'd guess that planting these will create a propeller that generates *considerable* thrust.
operator: Maybe it'll be helpful if you ever need to move something heavy?
operator: In any case, would you like to record any progress in your investigation?
- Yes
	operator: Saving progress...
	[signal arg="save_signal"]
	operator: Save complete.
	jump save_done
- No
	operator: Roger dodger! I'll be here if you need to save progress in the future.
	jump save_done
label save_done
operator: At that, I wish you the best of luck, Gardener.
operator: See you on the flip side!
[signal arg="scene_end_op"]
[end_timeline]